        "TileImage": "$($repository 856b2aa2-e224-48c3-b890-01fdf4dba6de).Image",
        "Description": "47, It&apos;s time to return to Whittleton Creek. It has been uncovered that Whittleton Creek is built right on top of an ancient native american burial ground of much historical significance. However, due to a dispute from the local wealthy residents, a recent court decision has made it impossible for excavation to take place so long as the relevant homeowners still currently reside there. \r\rOur client, a member of an Archeological Institution, would like you to correct that problem. Good Luck, 47.",
